# Implementation Plan - Minimal UI & Navigation System

## Goal
Update the user interface (buttons, controls, headers) to be "minimal" and professional, and implement a robust navigation system between lessons and steps.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I am proposing a **Side Navigation Drawer** (collapsible) that lists all available lessons and the steps within them. This replaces the header dropdown and provides a central hub for navigation.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] [Sidebar.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/MathLessonVisualiser/src/components/Sidebar.tsx) [NEW]
- **Lesson List**: Display "Orthogonality", "QR Factorization", etc.
- **Step List**: Under the active lesson, show the titles of all steps.
- **Minimal Style**: `backdrop-blur`, thin borders, consistent spacing, and micro-animations.

### [Component] [Player.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/MathLessonVisualiser/src/components/Player.tsx)
- **Refactored Layout**: Integrate the `Sidebar` component.
- **Minimal Header**: Remove the native `<select>`. Move lesson switching to the Sidebar.
- **Navigation Shortcuts**: Ensure easier jumping between non-adjacent steps.

### [Component] [Timeline.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/MathLessonVisualiser/src/components/Timeline.tsx)
- **Minimal Button Style**: Update playback buttons (Play, Next, Prev) with a new CSS-based design system (e.g., `minimal-btn` class).
- **Refined Scrubber**: A cleaner, more elegant progress bar.

### [Style] [index.css](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/MathLessonVisualiser/src/index.css)
- **New CSS Classes**:
    - `.minimal-btn`: Subtle hover states, focus rings, and proper feedback.
    - `.sidebar-container`: Layout and transitions for the shelf.
- **Design Tokens**: Add `---accent` and `--bg-glass` for consistent UI layering.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify the sidebar can be toggled opened/closed.
- Verify clicking a lesson in the sidebar switches the entire scene correctly.
- Verify clicking a step title in the sidebar jumps the player to that specific step.
- Verify the buttons have a consistent, premium feel with hover/active states.
